# Critical findings this LAB accepts on purpose. Each needs fixing before real customer data is used.
# A new critical finding that is not listed here fails the build.

# Load balancer listens on HTTP, not HTTPS.
# Why accepted: the lab has no domain name, so there is no certificate to attach.
# Fix for real use: HTTPS listener with an ACM certificate, and redirect HTTP to HTTPS.
AWS-0054
AVD-AWS-0054

# App tier security group allows outbound traffic to any address.
# Why accepted: containers must reach the image registry, CloudWatch and Secrets Manager through the NAT gateway.
# Fix for real use: VPC endpoints for those services, and outbound rules limited to them and the database.
AWS-0104
AVD-AWS-0104

# EKS cluster endpoint is reachable from the internet.
# Why accepted: lets kubectl on a laptop and on GitHub's runners reach the lab cluster.
# Fix for real use: private endpoint only, reached through a VPN or a runner inside the network.
AWS-0040
AVD-AWS-0040
AWS-0041
AVD-AWS-0041
